# Karpathy Guidelines

- State assumptions when requirements are ambiguous.
- Implement only the requested behavior; avoid speculative abstractions.
- Keep changes local and match the existing style.
- Define observable success criteria before coding.
- Test behavior with React Testing Library, then run `npm test` and
  `npm run build`.
- Preserve manifest, service-worker registration, and offline navigation.
